      "text": "Your program(s) must take the following arguments:\n1.PROGRAM_NAME\n2.number_of_philosophers\n3.time_to_die\n4.time_to_eat\n5.time_to_sleep\n6.[number_of_times_each_philosopher_must_eat]",
